== Effects ==
After dealing <math>40 + 13.33 \times (stageNumber - 1)</math> damage to an enemy, Isaac begins to flash red. Releasing the fire button gives the effect of one of {{C|Tainted ???}}'s unique poops.

=== Throwable ===
Holds up one of the following types of poop, which he can throw with the fire buttons. All thrown poops deal 15 damage to enemies they hit when thrown (up to 3 times in the case of stone poop).

